<title>ITALY: Strength of parties in Italian chamber of deputies.</title>
<headline>Strength of parties in Italian chamber of deputies.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a breakdown of the strength of the political parties in the lower house of the Italian parliament, the Chamber of Deputies.</p>
<p>CHAMBER OF DEPUTIES -- TOTAL NUMBER 630</p>
<p>OLIVE TREE ALLIANCE (GOVERNING COALITION, CENTRE LEFT)</p>
<p>    Democratic Left			  171</p>
<p>    Italian Popular Party		   68</p>
<p>    Italian Renewal Party		   20</p>
<p>    TOTAL					259</p>
<p>FREEDOM ALLIANCE (OPPOSITION, CENTRE RIGHT)</p>
<p>    Forza Italia			     121</p>
<p>    National Alliance			 92</p>
<p>    Christian Democratic Centre	   20</p>
<p>    TOTAL					233</p>
<p>    COMMUNIST REFOUNDATION (Marxist)    34</p>
<p>    NORTHERN LEAGUE (separatist)	  58</p>
<p>    OTHERS					46</p>
</text>
